text.en:
The Authority may, by notice in writing, revoke any permit granted under regulation 4 in respect of any temporary building if the person to whom the permit is granted —

(a) fails to comply with regulation 8;

(b) erects, or causes or permits the erection of, the temporary building other than in accordance with the plans in respect thereof approved by the Authority;

(c) fails to comply with any condition of the permit; or

(d) fails to maintain the temporary building in a satisfactory manner.
